<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<!--
  One process where the original mod had fourteen.

  Vanilla Cooking Expanded used to ship one cheese ThingDef per milk - VCE_GowCheese,
  VCE_WeirdCheese, VCE_RatCheese and ten more - so the original mod needed one ProcessDef each to
  name each product. In 1.6 all of them are gone: there is a single VCE_Cheese, and the milk it
  came from is read back off the stack by VEF.Things.CompProperties_LabelByIngredients, which
  renames it "gow cheese", "rat cheese" and so on. Naming any of the thirteen old defs here would
  be an unresolved cross-reference and nothing more.

  So the thirteen milks move from thirteen products to one ingredient filter. This is also the
  shape the framework's own tab wants: it lists products, with their ingredients as sub-nodes the
  player can allow one by one. Thirteen processes would have been thirteen identical "cheese"
  rows.

  Insect jelly is in the filter because VCE 1.6 makes cheese from it (VCE_JellyIntoCheese) and the
  label override for it is already in VCE_Cheese itself. The original mod predates that.

  The packageIds on the MayRequire lines, and the milk defNames, are taken from VCE's own 1.6
  add-on folders rather than from the original mod - Vanilla Genetics Expanded is
  VanillaExpanded.VGeneticsE now, and VCE gained AlphaBees support after the original mod stopped.
  Vanilla Factions Expanded - Insectoids is not here: VCE 1.6 dropped its cheese, and the
  packageId the original guarded on (oskarpotocki.vfe.insectoid) belongs to the superseded first
  version of that mod.

  capacityFactor, usesQuality and qualityDays are Daemon976's numbers, untouched.
-->
<Defs>

  <ProcessorFramework.ProcessDef>
    <defName>VCE_Cheese</defName>
    <thingDef>VCE_Cheese</thingDef>
    <ingredientFilter>
      <thingDefs>
        <li>Milk</li>
        <li>InsectJelly</li>
        <li MayRequire="sarg.alphaanimals">AA_GowMilk</li>
        <li MayRequire="sarg.alphaanimals">AA_BlueMilk</li>
        <li MayRequire="sarg.alphaanimals">AA_NightMilk</li>
        <li MayRequire="sarg.rimbees">RB_BeeMilk</li>
        <li MayRequire="VanillaExpanded.VGeneticsE">GR_WeirdMilk</li>
        <li MayRequire="VanillaExpanded.VGeneticsE">GR_MechaMilk</li>
        <li MayRequire="VanillaExpanded.VGeneticsE">GR_BearffaloMilk</li>
        <li MayRequire="VanillaExpanded.VGeneticsE">GR_ThrumffaloMilk</li>
        <li MayRequire="VanillaExpanded.VGeneticsE">GR_MuffalochickenMilk</li>
        <li MayRequire="VanillaExpanded.VGeneticsE">GR_ChickenffaloMilk</li>
        <li MayRequire="VanillaExpanded.VGeneticsE">GR_MuffalobearMilk</li>
        <li MayRequire="VanillaExpanded.VGeneticsE">GR_WolffaloMilk</li>
        <li MayRequire="VanillaExpanded.VGeneticsE">GR_RatMilk</li>
      </thingDefs>
    </ingredientFilter>
    <capacityFactor>2.5</capacityFactor>
    <usesQuality>true</usesQuality>
    <qualityDays>(1, 3, 6, 12, 24, 48, 60)</qualityDays>
  </ProcessorFramework.ProcessDef>

</Defs>
